==Trivia==
*Tormented demons are the second non-boss monster to have a [[Combat Achievements/Master|Master Combat Achievement]] ([[Three Times the Thrashing]]) the other being the [[Deathly ranger]]s and [[Deathly mage]]s from the [[Chambers of Xeric]] ([[No Time for Death]]), though they are the first non-boss monster that requires the player to actually kill them in order to complete the task.

